      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَبَّيْتُ الجَيْشَ</span></b> , (S, Msb,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَعْبِيَةٌ</span> (S, K)
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَعْبِئَةٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَعْبِىْءٌ</span>, so said Yoo; but AZ said
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَبَّأْتُهُ</span>; (S; [see art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عبأ</span>;]) <i>I prepared,</i> or <i>made
ready,</i> (S, K, *) or <i>set in order, disposed,</i> or
<i>arranged,</i> (Msb,) <i>the army</i> (S, Msb, K) <i>in their
places.</i> (S, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also 2 in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عبو</span>.

